# Momento front end: rules for AI coding assistants

CRITICAL FRONTEND RULE: Any UI, styling, or feature modifications made to this client MUST work strictly with the
existing Node.js backend endpoints, request/response schemas, authentication headers, and WebSocket events documented
in API_CONTRACT.md. Do not invent, rename, or alter backend routes or payload structures without updating the backend
together.

- Read API_CONTRACT.md, BACKEND-NOTES.md, BACKEND-NOTES-NEXT.md and src/lib/api.ts before calling the server.
- Every server call goes through src/lib/api.ts (or window.momentoFetch from public/assets/api.js).
- Read AGENTS.md: this Next.js version has breaking changes; check node_modules/next/dist/docs/ first.
